 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "Dots are (r, c) with 0 <= r, c <= 8. Each move places a new stick between two adjacent dots (no stick is placed twice). Moves strictly alternate: player 1 makes moves 1, 3, 5, ... and player 2 moves 2, 4, 6, ... A move that completes the fourth side of one or two unit squares scores those squares for the player who made it. Return 1 or 2 for the player with more squares after all moves, or 0 when the scores are equal.",
